Dear ARENA Team,

My name is Narges Farahani from Parsa International Group (Istanbul, T=C3=BCr=
kiye). We build AI software for industrial operations (oil, gas, petrochemica=
l, energy) and healthcare, and I would like to introduce one specific product=
 rather than our whole portfolio, because it matches your focus most closely.

The product: Gas Supply & Demand Optimization System
Network supply/demand balancing, forecast-driven dispatch and scenario optimi=
zation for gas grid operators.

Our match review points to Gas Supply & Demand Optimization System as the str=
ongest overlap with your focus: Supply/demand optimization fits energy-system=
 optimization; renewable integration and program eligibility need proof. Prov=
isional focus fit, not investment readiness or eligibility confirmation.

Maturity: validated prototype (TRL 4-5); the first real-data pilot on a partn=
er site is the agreed next milestone, and we would value exactly this convers=
ation with you.

A professional pitch deck is attached (Gas-supply-and-demand-optimization-sof=
tware-system.pptx) - it contains the technical summary, the validation eviden=
ce with the exact datasets and measured results, and cited market data. If yo=
u prefer a walkthrough, we are glad to give a short online presentation at yo=
ur convenience.

To be transparent about our stage: we are pre-commercial, seeking pilot partn=
ers and seed-stage funding, and we deliberately present each product to a sin=
gle investor whose focus overlaps the most. Would you be open to a 20-minute =
online call in the coming weeks?

